From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 09:52:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: prefer canonical Firestore menu IDs on restaurant detail

Legacy menu documents matched by Arabic restaurant name were shown
alongside the live catalog, so add-to-cart failed while menuLive was true.
Filter to canonical catalog IDs when present, and remove the obsolete
mobile responsive auto-apply workflow that cannot decode its payloads.
---
 .../workflows/apply-mobile-responsive-fix.yml | 44 -------------------
 .../DynamicRestaurantClient.tsx               | 21 ++++++---
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 51 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 .github/workflows/apply-mobile-responsive-fix.yml

diff --git a/.github/workflows/apply-mobile-responsive-fix.yml b/.github/workflows/apply-mobile-responsive-fix.yml
deleted file mode 100644
index bb518a3..0000000
--- a/.github/workflows/apply-mobile-responsive-fix.yml
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,44 +0,0 @@
-name: Apply mobile responsive fix
-
-on:
